 ratio of contracts just under the limit does not prove improper actions. It could reflect market conditions or budget constraints. The data is a statistical trend, not evidence of wrongdoing.\nWhat can be checked: Check the contracts' dates and awardees to see if multiple contracts serve the same purpose. Review the specific services purchased in December to identify patterns. Look at the contract details to confirm if the amounts were within budget or market rates.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["%2Bgikat36IJh%2FP7lJ7Fu0SA%3D%3D","ZYziIh7oAPOopEMYCmrbmw%3D%3D","Q6Es7gxrbf%2BOUi78BmzhOQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}